{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20288","headline":"塞下曲 · 张籍","name":"塞下曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"边州八月修城堡，候骑先烧碛中草。\n胡风吹沙度陇飞，陇头林木无北枝。\n将军阅兵青塞下，鸣鼓逢逢促猎围。\n天寒山路石断裂，白日不销帐上雪。\n乌孙国乱多降胡，诏使名王持汉节。\n年年征战不得闲，边人杀尽唯空山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20288.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20288","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}